# Thin Shell — Pattern B registry keying

Phase **4bl** locks how package-owned React/UI surfaces reach the shell without generated binders.
Phases **4bm–4bs** migrate every Pattern B singleton → `Map<pluginId, Surface>`.
Phase **4bt** retires host-adapter **active-pluginId** transitional: shell sync helpers take `pluginId` first; `app-cloud.wizardHostAdapterActivePluginId` is removed.

**Pattern B honesty closed for Map keying + host-adapter sync threading** (4bs + 4bt).

## Contract

1. Capability on the frozen plugin exposes **only** `ensureReady` (no React).
2. Package `ensureReady` string-key `import()`s UI and publishes on a product-blind `globalThis` key.
3. Shell registry peeks that key — never imports product UI statically.
4. **Publish/peek key = `pluginId`** via `Map<string, Surface>` on the global key.
5. Host-adapter sync helpers (`buildWizardFreshStartMeta`, catalog sanitize, localize, etc.) take **`pluginId` as the first argument** and fail closed when cold / unknown — no ambient active-id.

```text
ensureReady()
    │
    ▼
import("../ui/…")  // string-keyed
    │
    ▼
globalThis[KEY].set(pluginId, surface)
    │
    ▼
shell peek(pluginId) → surface | null   // fail-closed when cold / unknown id
```

## Inventory (4bl–4bs) — all Map-keyed

| Global key | Capability | Phase |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `app-cloud.wizardCreateChromeSurface` | `createChrome` | 4bl |
| `app-cloud.wizardFlatEditChromeSurface` | `flatEditChrome` | 4bm |
| `app-cloud.wizardCreateViewSurface` | `createView` | 4bn |
| `app-cloud.wizardFlatEditFormSurface` | `flatEditForm` | 4bo |
| `app-cloud.wizardFlatEditPageSurface` | `flatEditPage` | 4bp |
| `app-cloud.operatorUiComponentsSurface` | `operatorUi` | 4bq |
| `app-cloud.wizardHostAdapterSurface` | `wizardHost` adapters | 4br + **4bt** (sync `pluginId`) |
| `app-cloud.settingsEquipmentUiSurface` | `settingsEquipmentUi` | **4bs** |
| `app-cloud.settingsExposureSurfacesUiSurface` | `settingsExposureSurfacesUi` | **4bs** |
| `app-cloud.wizardLabelResolverCache` | `labels` | earlier Map |
| `app-cloud.wizardCompositeSurfaceCache` | `wizardSurfaces` | earlier Map |
| `app-cloud.wizardReviewSurfaceCache` | `wizardSurfaces` | earlier Map |
| `app-cloud.wizardCreateCache` | `wizardCreate` | membership |

### Singleton debt

**None** (closed in 4bs).

### Active-pluginId debt

**None** (closed in 4bt — key deleted; sync helpers require `pluginId`).

## Guards / tests

- `apps/web/test/thin-shell-pattern-b-registry.spec.ts` — inventory + Map contracts (4bl–4bt)
- Do not delete opaque §2.4 loaders to “fix” Pattern B

